<verse_n verse_n="3">
<translation translation="Afterwards, the savior appeared to our father and spoke with him, saying, “Peace be with you, my honorable fellow companion, beloved of my father. Behold, the time has come for you to reveal my glory, so that my name is glorified through you over the earth.">
