<verse_n verse_n="5">
<translation translation="So the shrine I have granted to you is the altar, and the stele is the body of my servant, Anoup. Behold, I have told you all the things that will happen to you, through the full counsel of my father. Be diligent in the things I have told you, and do not doubt.">
