<p_n p_n="18">
<chapter_n chapter_n="18">
<verse_n verse_n="1">
<translation translation="When morning came, a young brother, Zacharias, lay to rest, and he had been a sweet child towards all, and my father loved him a lot due to the good deeds he did. We took him into the church, and the brothers continued meditating over him until he was prepared for burial.">
