<verse_n verse_n="8">
<translation translation="“God—Jesus Christ, our Lord—is One.” All who were standing were amazed, and he said, “Believe me, O devout people, that all who stand here today, God has forgiven their sins like on the day they were born, and whoever kneels here today will have their sins forgiven in the name of our brother Apa Phib. Great is this secret, my brothers and my devout fathers.”">
