</verse_n>
<verse_n verse_n="10">
<translation translation="The crowd that saw him was amazed, and their hearts became steadfast, and they learned that repentance comes from God, and that God has bestowed the gift of the forgiving of sins to our brother Apa Phib. Glory to the holy trinity, the Father, the Son, and the Holy Spirit, forever and ever, Amen.">
